---
const b = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="mono-label hero-label">
        <span class="lang-en">Quantitative Research · Systems · Reproduction</span>
        <span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">量化研究 · 研究系统 · 实证复现</span>
      </div>
      <h1>
        <span class="lang-en">Turning Data Into <span class="accent">Alpha.</span></span>
        <span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">将数据转化为 <span class="accent">Alpha。</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p>
        <span class="lang-en">I build quantitative research systems, investigate robust signals, and design systematic strategies across futures, factor research, and machine learning.</span>
        <span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">我构建量化研究系统，研究稳健信号，并围绕期货、因子研究与机器学习设计系统化策略。</span>
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={`${b}research-projects/`}><span class="lang-en">Explore Research &amp; Projects</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">探索研究与项目</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="button hero-button" href={`${b}cv/`}><span class="lang-en">View CV</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">查看简历</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { background: var(--hero); color: var(--hero-ink); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); }
  .hero-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 350px; padding-top: 54px; padding-bottom: 54px; }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 900px; }
  .hero-label { margin-bottom: 18px; color: #83a0ae; }
  .hero h1 { margin: 0; max-width: 820px; font: 700 clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.45rem)/.98 var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .hero h1 .accent { color: var(--accent); }
  .hero-copy>p { max-width: 760px; margin: 20px 0 0; color: #c5d1d8; font: 400 1.02rem/1.65 var(--font-mono); }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 26px; }
  .hero-button { border-color: #52606b; background: transparent; color: #f5f8fa; }
  .hero-button:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  @media(max-width:640px){.hero-inner{min-height:auto;padding-top:48px;padding-bottom:48px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.55rem,13vw,4.1rem)}.hero-copy>p{font-size:.95rem}}
</style>
